  "content": "<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/WyOEKvso/images/63a351d86063d9d0bdc009f1fd65dcfacaaa5bbd.png\" alt=\"舊版Jappa木板\"><br>\n\n<p>\n這個資源包將木板紋理恢復至<a href=\"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Java_Edition_18w43a\">18w43a</a>快照版本。新木材類型的木板，如紅樹林、櫻花、緋紅和扭曲木，也改為使用此快照中的風格。\n</p>\n\n<p>您可以在這裡支持我和我的專案：</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/SomeImages/blob/main/patreon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>\n\n</p>\n\n<h3>預覽：</h3>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/WyOEKvso/images/140621d771fcc8bf3bc3f8588a4b9ed686f9e579.png\">",
